  "title": "Sour Cream Noodle Bake",
  "description": "This simple, hearty casserole features ground beef browned in butter and simmered with tomato sauce, garlic salt and pepper. Fold in cottage cheese, sour cream, green onions and egg noodles, then bake with Cheddar cheese sprinkled over the top.",
  "authors": [
